# CommunityDash — Product & Design Spec (v1 Baseline)

**Working title:** CommunityDash  
**Status:** Spec for v1 baseline (current codebase is a partial prototype; About’s “1.0.0” is aspirational)  
**Last updated:** 2026-07-08

---

## 1. Executive summary

### Goal
A **localized, completely free** app for creating, tracking, and sharing **highly visual daily dashboards**. Users manage cognitive load by turning simple goals (water, exercise, tasks) into glanceable progress visuals—not a bloated habit OS.

### Non-negotiables
| Principle | Decision |
|-----------|----------|
| Price | **100% free forever.** No premium tiers, ads, or freemium. |
| Backend | **None required.** Local-first; no accounts, no SaaS dependency. |
| Support | Single unobtrusive donation link (**Ko-fi — do not change**). |
| Hosting model | Offline / on-device primary. **Public web deploy = GitHub Pages only** (free static hosting). No Vercel / Cloudflare / Netlify plan. |
| Open source | Public repo; community-friendly. |

### Target platforms (priority)
1. **Web (desktop + mobile browser)** — ship and polish first  
2. **Android / iOS** via Expo (same codebase; after web baseline is solid)  
3. Desktop install is optional later (PWA / Tauri / etc.—not v1)

### Product one-liner
> Local daily goals with beautiful visuals, history you can look back on, and shareable templates—no account, no cloud tax.

