## 2. Product decisions (locked for v1)

| Topic | Decision |
|-------|----------|
| Data residency | On-device (AsyncStorage / localStorage). Optional static hosting only serves the app shell; user data never leaves the browser/device unless the user exports it. |
| Daily progress history | **Full history charts** — retain completion data over time (not “today only”). |
| Reuse | **Both** goal **history** (reuse single past goals) **and** named multi-goal **templates**. |
| Navigation | Responsive: **mobile-native chrome** (bottom tabs) on narrow viewports; **sidebar** (or rail) on wide layouts. |
| Over target | **Allowed.** Visuals and UI must show overflow (e.g. 12/10) clearly. |
| Scope of v1 | **Baseline product** with the features in this doc—not a thin demo. |
| Sacred | Free forever · no required backend · Ko-fi link unchanged. Everything else may be revitalized. |

