## 4. Data models

All data lives in structured JSON on device. Include `schemaVersion` at the root of persisted store.

### 4.1 Dashboard item (active goal)
```ts
{
  id: string;                 // uuid
  title: string;
  currentValue: number;       // may exceed targetValue
  targetValue: number;        // > 0
  stepSize: number;           // default 1; used by + / -
  unit: string;               // optional display, e.g. "glasses"
  visualType: VisualType;
  colorTheme: string;         // hex
  resetInterval: 'daily';     // v1: daily only; field reserved for later
  createdAt: string;          // ISO
  lastUpdated: string;        // ISO — last interaction, not reset marker alone
  sortOrder: number;          // for manual reorder
}
```

**Visual types (v1 keep/extend as branded set):**  
`liquidWave` | `neonGlow` | `batteryCore` | `gradientBar` | `pizzaSlices` | `sunHorizon` | `hourglass` | `radarScope`

### 4.2 Daily snapshot (history charts)
On each **local calendar day** boundary (and after meaningful updates), persist per-goal and aggregate stats.

```ts
// One row per calendar day (device local timezone)
{
  date: string;               // "YYYY-MM-DD" local
  goals: {
    [dashboardId: string]: {
      title: string;          // snapshot title for historical accuracy
      currentValue: number;
      targetValue: number;
      unit: string;
      completed: boolean;     // currentValue >= targetValue at end-of-day or last write
      colorTheme?: string;
    };
  };
  completedCount: number;
  totalCount: number;
  percentage: number;         // completedCount / totalCount * 100
}
```

**Retention (v1):** keep **all** daily snapshots (user’s machine; full history charts). Provide Settings action: “Clear history” separate from “Erase all data.” Cap only if storage becomes an issue (document a soft warning > ~2 years later—not a hard product limit in v1).

### 4.3 Goal history (reuse single goals)
Auto-captured blueprints when a user creates a goal (or explicitly “save to history”).

```ts
{
  id: string;
  title: string;
  targetValue: number;
  stepSize: number;
  unit: string;
  visualType: VisualType;
  colorTheme: string;
  lastUsedAt: string;         // ISO
}
```

**Rules:**
- Deduplicate by normalized title + target + unit + visual + color + step (or soft-dedupe by title with update).
- Cap list length (e.g. 50) with LRU eviction, or unlimited with search—**prefer cap 100 + search** for sanity.

### 4.4 Named template (multi-goal blueprint)
User-named packs of goals for personal reuse and sharing.

```ts
{
  id: string;
  templateName: string;
  createdAt: string;
  dashboards: TemplateItem[]; // structure only — no currentValue
}

// TemplateItem
{
  title: string;
  targetValue: number;
  stepSize: number;
  unit: string;
  visualType: VisualType;
  colorTheme: string;
}
```

**Export/import payload** (share code content after decompress):
```json
{
  "v": 1,
  "templateName": "Hydration Station",
  "dashboards": [ /* TemplateItem[] */ ]
}
```

Strip `id`, `currentValue`, `lastUpdated`, history. Validate on import (types, positive targets, known visual types with fallback).

