## 12. Risks & open concerns

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| localStorage quota with years of history | Compact snapshot shape; monitor size; optional “export & prune” later |
| Timezone / travel across midnight | Always use **device local** calendar date; document behavior |
| Share codes get huge with many goals | lz-string; warn if code > N chars; multi-template not one mega-export |
| Visual overflow clutter | Design one consistent overflow language across all 8 visuals |
| Scope creep into “habit app with social” | Hold v1 DoD; park ideas in §13 |
| GitHub Pages base-path / asset bugs | Document `trailingSlash` + project-site base path; test on real Pages URL only (no multi-host matrix) |

